{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/avot/barukh_attah"}}
{"text":"Blessed art Thou, O Lord our God and God of our fathers, God of Abraham, God of Isaac and God of Jacob, great, mighty and awe-inspiring God, God the Most High, who performs acts of kindness and owns everything and remembers the good deeds of the fathers and will bring a redeemer for their children’s children for His Name’s sake in love."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
